  "notes": [
    "Regular -AR verb — follows standard -AR endings with no exceptions",
    "Past participle: *inventado* (regular)",
    "Means \"to invent\" (create something new) or \"to make up\" (a story, excuse, lie) — *inventó una excusa* (he made up an excuse), *inventaron el teléfono* (they invented the telephone)",
    "*¡No inventes!* is a common colloquial exclamation meaning \"No way!\" / \"You're kidding!\"",
